-- textwrap: wrapping, filling and indenting text for a terminal.
--
-- A port of Rust's `textwrap` crate, version 0.16.2, with its default
-- features: widths from `unicodeWidth`, word boundaries from
-- `unicodeLinebreak`, and optimal-fit wrapping. The tests hold it to the
-- crate's answers for thousands of texts and options.
--
--   use Textwrap (wrap, fill, options)
--
--   wrap (options 18) "Memory safety without garbage collection."
--     -- ["Memory safety", "without garbage", "collection."]

